====================================================================
PolyKernel T35 Wave 7: Dataflow simulator core
  64x64 PE grid; PE = CE (4x FP16 FMAC, 64b datapath) + 48KB SRAM
  (8 banks x 6KB, 2R+1W/cycle) + 5-port router (RAMP+E/W/N/S, 32b/link,
  single-cycle hop, lossless backpressure). Wavelet = 32b (16b data +
  16b control). Color = 5-bit tag, 24 routable (IDs 0-23), virtual
  channels over a shared physical link.
  NOTE: a GPU-free functional/cycle SIMULATOR - does NOT compile real
  CSL and does NOT run on Cerebras hardware.
Evidence: ctest -R router|color|grid (single-cycle hop, multicast tx,
          24-color isolation, SRAM bank model).
